        "original_id": "e3efaaa2-6e87-5f12-b446-c056b8a8cb9b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1993 Tehran mid-air collision\n- Companies: Iran Air Tours\n- Organizations: Islamic Republic of Iran Air Force (IRIAF)\n- Places: Tehran, Iran\n- Products: Tupolev Tu-154M, Sukhoi Su-24\n\nFacts:\n- On Monday, February 8, 1993, the 1993 Tehran mid-air collision occurred just outside Tehran, the capital of Iran.\n- The 1993 Tehran mid-air collision killed all 133 people on board the two aircraft involved.\n- Iran Air Tours operated a Tupolev Tu-154M with registration EP-ITD in the 1993 Tehran mid-air collision.\n- The Islamic Republic of Iran Air Force (IRIAF) operated a Sukhoi Su-24 attack aircraft in the 1993 Tehran mid-air collision.\n- Iran Air Tours is an airline based in Tehran, Iran.",
